    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Revision work · Quoted after examination\",\"title\":\"Re-circumcision and revision\",\"lede\":\"We assess children and adults who have previously been circumcised but are unhappy with the result or have a clinical problem that needs correction.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Re-circumcision\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Reasons for revision can include excess remaining foreskin, an uneven result, prominent scarring or another issue identified on examination.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Revision is not a one-size-fits-all procedure. A consultation is usually needed so the practitioner can examine the area, understand what you would like corrected and explain what is realistically achievable.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The technique, anaesthetic, healing time and price depend on the individual case. Contact the clinic for an assessment and quotation. See also <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\">phimosis</a> if tightness after a previous circumcision is the concern.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"At a glance\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Who\",\"v\":\"Children and adults\"},{\"k\":\"Consultation\",\"v\":\"Usually needed first\"},{\"k\":\"Price\",\"v\":\"Quoted after examination\"},{\"k\":\"Technique\",\"v\":\"Depends on the individual case\"}],\"note\":\"\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eNext step\\u003c/span\\u003e\"} /--><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"display d-2\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-2\">Contact the clinic for an assessment</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A consultation is usually needed so the practitioner can examine the area, understand what you would like corrected and explain what is realistically achievable.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/rich-html {\"html\":\"\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022book-recirc\\u0022\\u003eBook a consultation\\u003c/a\\u003e\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Tell us what happened\",\"formId\":\"recirc\",\"subject\":\"re-circumcision enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->"
